# Astan – Account and Data Deletion

**Last Updated:** June 2026

At Astan, we respect your privacy and your right to control your personal information. This page explains how you can request the deletion of your Astan account and associated data.

## Requesting Account Deletion

If you would like to permanently delete your Astan account and associated data, please submit a deletion request by email.

**Email:** [contact.astan@gmail.com](mailto:contact.astan@gmail.com)

**Subject:** Account Deletion Request

To help us verify your identity and process your request, please include:

* Your Astan Identity Code (if available)
* The email address associated with your account
* Any additional information that may help identify your account

## Data That Will Be Deleted

When your deletion request is approved and processed, we will permanently delete the following information associated with your account, where applicable:

* Account profile information
* User-created projects, ideas, and content
* Messages and interactions stored by Astan
* Account identifiers and authentication records
* Other personal information associated with your account

## Data Retention

Certain information may be temporarily retained for security, legal, fraud prevention, backup, or operational purposes. Such data will be securely removed in accordance with our retention practices.

Backup data may remain for up to **30 days** before permanent deletion.

## Processing Time

Deletion requests are typically processed within **7 days** of successful account verification. In some cases, additional time may be required to complete the deletion process.

## Contact Us

If you have questions regarding account deletion, privacy, or your personal data, please contact:

**Email:** [contact.astan@gmail.com](mailto:contact.astan@gmail.com)

For additional information about how Astan collects, uses, and protects personal information, please refer to our Privacy Policy and Terms of Use.
